{"synopsis":"Lu Zhou bangun untuk menjadi Patriark jahat paling kuat dan tertua di dunia dan menemukan bahwa dia memiliki sembilan murid terkenal yang penuh dengan kejahatan Murid tertuanya adalah pemimpin Sekte Nether dengan ribuan antekantek dan murid keduanyaPedang Iblisselalu membantai orang lain dengan perselisihan sekecil apa pun\nTanpa basis kultivasinya bagaimana dia akan menangani muridmurid jahat ini\nMurid tertuanya Yu Zhenghai berkata Saya tidak pernah memiliki saingan dalam hidup saya dan tidak seorang pun kecuali Guru yang dapat membuat saya menundukkan kepala\nMurid ketujuhnya Si Wuya berkata Kita tidak bisa makan atau tidur dengan tenang selama Guru belum mati\n\nMurid kesembilannya Yuaner berkata Saya akan mengingat apa yang Guru katakan dan menjadi orang baik","alternative_title":"My Apprentices Are All Great Villains","author":"月天","artist":"月天","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"649737be-f777-4d5c-bb2b-2e8fd6221e79","number":"541","chapter":"541","title":"","date":"2026-08-02","released":"2026-08-02"},{"chapter_id":"95bd90f1-1893-4bd4-bf35-e76af9edc2ed","number":"540","chapter":"540","title":"","date":"2026-08-01","released":"2026-08-01"},{"chapter_id":"fc8bf173-7dd0-4866-8ac4-8815fc9b7f43","number":"539","chapter":"539","title":"","date":"2026-07-31","released":"2026-07-31"},{"chapter_id":"4525b4bb-5bba-44f2-b3d0-964b4444b8be","number":"538","chapter":"538","title":"","date":"2026-07-25","released":"2026-07-25"},{"chapter_id":"1cb45f8d-372f-42eb-8761-ab6ebf222dd0","number":"537","chapter":"537","title":"","date":"2026-07-24","released":"2026-07-24"},{"chapter_id":"77a207eb-5a89-4938-944c-3ebac404b6b8","number":"536","chapter":"536","title":"","date":"2026-07-23","released":"2026-07-23"},{"chapter_id":"f09ca618-dc1d-4a92-b332-342d05f1b33f","number":"535","chapter":"535","title":"","date":"2026-07-21","released":"2026-07-21"},{"chapter_id":"b706e081-20b0-4226-8682-36d60abc5e97","number":"534","chapter":"534","title":"","date":"2026-07-18","released":"2026